<p>Add SEO auditing to your GitHub Actions deployment pipeline. The workflow below runs six essential checks on every production deployment and fails the pipeline if any endpoint returns a non-200 status:</p>

<pre><code>name: SEO Audit on Deploy
on:
  deployment_status:
    states: [success]
jobs:
